MDeer bundles the following third-party work. Generated by [cargo-about](https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-about) from `about.hbs`; do not edit by hand.

## Bundled assets

- **Tokyo Night colours** (`assets/tokyo-night.tmTheme`, `src/theme.rs`): from [folke/tokyonight.nvim](https://github.com/folke/tokyonight.nvim) (Apache-2.0), based on [enkia/tokyo-night-vscode-theme](https://github.com/enkia/tokyo-night-vscode-theme) (MIT).
- **Fonts** (Ubuntu Light, Hack, Noto Emoji, emoji-icon-font): embedded through the `epaint_default_fonts` crate; licenses below.
- **Syntax definitions and themes**: embedded through the `syntect` crate, which bundles a snapshot of [sublimehq/Packages](https://github.com/sublimehq/Packages) under its own permissive license.

